        "original_id": "c2acc6c6-32f6-5211-8a42-be21956a4f53",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: M. Night Shyamalan, Olivia DeJonge, Ed Oxenbould, Deanna Dunagan, Peter McRobbie, Kathryn Hahn\n- Works: The Village, Lady in the Water, The Happening, The Last Airbender, After Earth, The Visit\n- Topics: Film reception, film genres\n\nFacts:\n- After earlier successes, M. Night Shyamalan released a run of poorly received but sometimes financially successful films: The Village (2004), Lady in the Water (2006), The Happening (2008), The Last Airbender (2010), and After Earth (2013).\n- The Village is a 2004 historical drama-horror film by M. Night Shyamalan.\n- Lady in the Water is a 2006 fantasy film by M. Night Shyamalan.\n- The Happening is a 2008 disaster film by M. Night Shyamalan.\n- The Last Airbender is a 2010 film adaptation directed by M. Night Shyamalan.\n- After Earth is a 2013 science-fiction film by M. Night Shyamalan.\n- The Visit is a 2015 American found footage horror film written and directed by M. Night Shyamalan.\n- The Visit stars Olivia DeJonge, Ed Oxenbould, Deanna Dunagan, Peter McRobbie, and Kathryn Hahn.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
